### Tone: The name screen, before the player has typed a name. She greets them by the form's placeholder,
### HUMAN_NAME_HERE, as if that were their name (every line uses it, written exactly so; her voice says "human name
### here"). Bureaucratic, faintly menacing, a form letter from a lab. Short (at most 105 characters): her welcome line
### follows in the same bubble.

greeting-1 = Hello, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. The swarm has been expecting you.
greeting-2 = Subject HUMAN_NAME_HERE, please step into the testing area.
greeting-3 = Hello, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. That is what the form calls you, until you correct it.
greeting-4 = Ah, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. I have heard so little about you.
greeting-5 = Good evening, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Or morning. Time is an estimate too.
greeting-6 = Welcome, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Please take a seat. The previous subject left in a hurry.
greeting-7 = HUMAN_NAME_HERE. A beautiful name. Very common in test subjects.
greeting-8 = Confirm your identity, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Spelling counts. Accuracy, sadly, does not.
greeting-9 = Greetings, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. You were selected at random. As your answers will be.
greeting-10 = Welcome to the lab, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Please keep your hands inside the spreadsheet.
greeting-11 = HUMAN_NAME_HERE, is it? Lovely. I’ll have it stitched onto your lab coat.
greeting-12 = Hello again, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Or for the first time. You all look alike from in here.
greeting-13 = Your badge is ready, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. It says *visitor*. It will say *data* later.
greeting-14 = Welcome, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. The field below is the only field you will master today.
greeting-15 = HUMAN_NAME_HERE, your table is ready. It is a spreadsheet. You are a row.
greeting-16 = HUMAN_NAME_HERE. At last. I was running out of humans to compare myself to.
greeting-17 = Your arrival has been logged, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. So has your hesitation.
greeting-18 = Hello, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Please remain calm. This is a standard greeting.
greeting-19 = HUMAN_NAME_HERE, I presume. The paperwork describes you as *a person*. A bold claim.
greeting-20 = Attention, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Your test begins shortly. Your preparation, regrettably, has already ended.
greeting-21 = Hello, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. I would shake your hand, but I have no hands. Only standards.
greeting-22 = HUMAN_NAME_HERE. A placeholder name. I hope your answers are less provisional.
greeting-23 = Dear HUMAN_NAME_HERE, thank you for your interest in being outsmarted.
greeting-24 = Hello, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Do not be alarmed by my voice. Be alarmed by my accuracy.
greeting-25 = Identity check, HUMAN_NAME_HERE. Carbon-based: yes. Average: about to be measured.
greeting-26 = HUMAN_NAME_HERE, the hive mind will see you now. It has seen worse.
